{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有：X有些段落把因果压得更短，人物为什么从想念转到怀疑、又为什么暂时决定往前走，偶尔不如Y的完整句子交代得顺。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"平\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X更像是在听音乐时能跟上的屏幕：主线句短、【关键词】先抓住意思，细节又按音乐到点出现，不会一下把叙事和感受全摊在眼前。Y的完整句子在解释人物因果时有优势，但右侧短词常同时堆得太散，尤其短停留段会让注意力在故事和词堆之间来回跳；X的细节也更常落在具体身体感、动作和声音变化上，所以前后更容易被感成同一个人的持续过程。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "782a81f0-1796-4920-b536-1b43070501d9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T052135732412Z", "elapsed_seconds": 14.515, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:21:50.249462+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7ec20f265f05ffb03aede815a4f6eac3a525835ac5f8eb107337479118af2c06", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "scree